# Archive executed plans

When a plan has been fully executed (all its todos done and the user has confirmed or the work is complete), move the plan file into the matching `old plans` folder as the final step of the task:

| Plan location | Archive to |
|---|---|
| `~/.cursor/plans/*.plan.md` (Cursor Plan mode) | `~/.cursor/plans/old plans/` |
| Plan docs in this repo (e.g. `*_PLAN.md` under `docs/`, `markdown_documents/`, `sitehub_worker_Ready/docs/`) | `docs/old plans/` |

- Use `git mv` for files tracked by git, plain `mv` otherwise. Keep the original filename.
- Only archive plans that were actually executed; leave partially done or not-started plans in place.
- Never archive these active plans unless the user says so:
  - `sitehub_worker_Ready/docs/OFFLINE_SIGN_IN_PLAN.md`
  - `~/.cursor/plans/investor_differentiation_roadmap_f3e86d8d.plan.md`- Mention the move in the final summary to the user.
